# $backupClassHeld v1 2026-09-09 (holdcommit v1) — $backupClass with the net.
# One call, so a caller changes ONE word per call site instead of gaining a line.
# $holdBackup runs FIRST and its note is computed before $backupClass is asked,
# because the order of the two notes is the order of the two operations.
#
# $backupClass itself is untouched and still does the whole backup on its own for
# every other caller. A backup taken through THIS door is the one $commitBackups
# may undo; a backup taken through the old door is final, as it always was.

Calculate note as ''
If pClassRef
	If pClassRef.$classtype*1>0
		If pos('execBackup_',pClassRef.$lib().$name)<>1
			Calculate note as $cinst.$ensureVault(con('execBackup_',pClassRef.$lib().$name))
		End If
	End If
End If
Calculate note as con(note,$cinst.$holdBackup(pClassRef))
Quit method con($cinst.$backupClass(pClassRef),note)